Subject: [11] Start proofs with an empty private substitution cache, seven Inference Systems proofs

Measurement: 1.46 → 0.92 s. 842 → 813 MiB. Allocation on the five large CHERI proofs was essentially unchanged by this change alone.

diff --git a/src/prover/eproofcheck.lisp b/src/prover/eproofcheck.lisp
